CIVILIZATION: SERBIA
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Civilization Ability (Combined):
- International and domestic Trade Routes passing through Serbian territory yield +2 Gold and +1 Culture.
- Roads built inside Serbian borders upgrade one tier earlier than usual.
- Strategic and luxury resource mines yield +1 Production and +1 Faith.
- Defensive structures (Walls, Encampments, etc.) provide +1 Culture and +1 Loyalty per turn.

